WEBVTT

00:00:06.540 --> 00:00:10.320
The Max Mama jacket and Cecile Magobe dress!

00:00:10.320 --> 00:00:13.510
The Blueberry Fields pants and Bikka socks!

00:00:13.510 --> 00:00:15.840
I can’t wait for the bargain sale at Le Chalet’s.

00:00:15.840 --> 00:00:18.510
I’ve been saving my allowance for this occasion.

00:00:18.510 --> 00:00:22.210
I’m definitely going to buy a Bali-Bali skirt today!

00:00:27.100 --> 00:00:31.170
<i>This train is going out of service because
an animal has got onboard.</i>

00:00:31.170 --> 00:00:33.860
Aw! How come!?

00:00:33.860 --> 00:00:35.890
We’re going to be late for the clearance sales!

00:00:35.400 --> 00:00:37.770
Excuse me! Step aside please!

00:00:45.710 --> 00:00:48.770
So-sorry! I’m in a rush, so...

00:00:49.170 --> 00:00:51.960
Eh? EhhhHHH!?

00:00:51.960 --> 00:00:52.740
The cat...!

00:00:52.740 --> 00:00:56.760
HEEY! YOU STRAY CAT!
HOW DID YOU GET INSIDE?!

00:00:59.300 --> 00:01:01.510
It spoke... right?

00:01:01.510 --> 00:01:02.870
What did?

00:01:02.870 --> 00:01:05.820
Come on! We’re going to be late.

00:01:15.780 --> 00:01:18.650
Th- The cat... it spoke?!

00:01:18.650 --> 00:01:21.310
Are you sure it wasn’t a dream or something?

00:01:21.310 --> 00:01:23.450
I’m telling you it’s true!

00:01:23.450 --> 00:01:25.770
No one believed me though.

00:01:25.770 --> 00:01:29.250
Bu-Ling wants to meet the speaking cat too!

00:01:29.250 --> 00:01:31.570
Could it have been a Chimera Anima?

00:01:32.960 --> 00:01:36.260
It didn’t really look harmful...

00:01:40.470 --> 00:01:42.120
Huh? EhhhHHH!?

00:01:42.930 --> 00:01:46.640
He-hey! Aren’t you the cat that was
at the train station this morning!?

00:01:46.640 --> 00:01:51.790
Yeah, I’m sorry! I didn’t really think
they would stop the train for a cat.

00:01:51.790 --> 00:01:54.110
You... You spoke!

00:01:54.650 --> 00:01:56.510
You really can talk after all!

00:01:56.510 --> 00:01:58.860
See! Didn’t I tell you?

00:01:58.860 --> 00:02:01.470
This here is the authentic speaking cat!

00:02:05.030 --> 00:02:07.460
Uh? What’s wrong, everyone?

00:02:08.040 --> 00:02:10.440
Is it possible? Shocked silence because of the surprise?

00:02:11.040 --> 00:02:13.080
Hey, Ichigo... What are you
talking about?

00:02:13.080 --> 00:02:18.400
I know! Only Ichigo-san can hear the cat speaking!

00:02:18.400 --> 00:02:20.420
EHHH!!?

00:02:20.420 --> 00:02:21.590
Is that true?

00:02:21.590 --> 00:02:22.720
Yes, it is.

00:02:22.720 --> 00:02:25.430
It seems that only you can understand what I’m saying.

00:02:25.430 --> 00:02:27.250
That’s why I came here...

00:02:27.970 --> 00:02:32.750
It would seem that the peculiar side effects of the cat DNA are beginning to appear.

00:02:32.750 --> 00:02:36.920
Last time, you transformed into
a cat, could that be the reason?

00:02:36.920 --> 00:02:39.610
I wonder...

00:02:39.610 --> 00:02:41.930
As a matter of fact, I came here to ask you a favor.

00:02:42.910 --> 00:02:44.350
A favor?

00:02:46.280 --> 00:02:48.410
Call me Asano.

00:02:48.410 --> 00:02:50.450
The truth is that I don’t have a name...

00:02:50.450 --> 00:02:52.790
But when I was born,
I lived at Asano’san’s,

00:02:52.790 --> 00:02:54.920
so you can call me Asano.

00:02:55.820 --> 00:02:58.280
Asano... Asano-kun right?

00:03:01.630 --> 00:03:03.630
So, what’s the favor?

00:03:03.630 --> 00:03:05.890
I want you to look for a certain cat.

00:03:05.890 --> 00:03:07.200
A cat?

00:03:07.200 --> 00:03:09.720
Yes, that cat...

00:03:09.720 --> 00:03:13.640
She is a house cat, so she can’t go out.

00:03:13.640 --> 00:03:16.130
That’s why I thought
I could ask a human.

00:03:16.130 --> 00:03:17.610
I see.

00:03:17.610 --> 00:03:19.780
So, what kind of cat is she?

00:03:19.780 --> 00:03:21.940
She’s a Lilac Point girl cat.

00:03:21.940 --> 00:03:23.390
Lilac Point?

00:03:23.390 --> 00:03:27.850
“Lilac Point” is the most precious kind of Siamese, isn’t it?

00:03:27.850 --> 00:03:29.740
One of my friends used to have one.

00:03:29.740 --> 00:03:34.370
The mouth, ears, tail and limbs are a pale-lilac colour...

00:03:34.370 --> 00:03:39.280
I’m sure that cat is an elegant and
lovely super-princess just like me.

00:03:40.460 --> 00:03:43.240
Why are you looking for that cat?

00:03:43.240 --> 00:03:45.030
She’s my lover...

00:03:45.030 --> 00:03:46.220
Lover!?

00:03:46.220 --> 00:03:46.990
Ehh!!

00:03:46.990 --> 00:03:50.500
It was a very sunny day in May...

00:03:53.940 --> 00:03:56.340
<i>HEY! YOU STRAY CAT!</i>

00:03:56.340 --> 00:03:58.840
<i>WAIT!</i>

00:04:01.570 --> 00:04:06.200
That day, I wandered into a garden
with a somewhat pleasant scent.

00:04:14.080 --> 00:04:15.830
<i>H-Hello!</i>

00:04:15.830 --> 00:04:16.980
<i>What’s that?</i>

00:04:18.170 --> 00:04:19.210
<i>It’s a sardine.</i>

00:04:19.210 --> 00:04:20.150
<i>Sardine?</i>

00:04:20.590 --> 00:04:22.000
<i>You don’t know what it is?</i>

00:04:22.000 --> 00:04:25.630
<i>Salted sardines, dried sardines, sardines
in oil, tiny sardines, and canned...</i>

00:04:25.630 --> 00:04:28.430
<i>A flash-fried tray of dried sardines...</i>

00:04:28.430 --> 00:04:30.870
<i>You know, sardines are special for us cats!</i>

00:04:32.540 --> 00:04:35.430
<i>What do you normally eat?</i>

00:04:35.430 --> 00:04:40.500
<i>Lean tuna sashimi, skinless chicken
breast, rabbit pateé...</i>

00:04:41.270 --> 00:04:43.220
<i>What are those?</i>

00:04:43.220 --> 00:04:48.430
<i>But I would like to eat the sardines that you like so much.</i>

00:04:48.430 --> 00:04:50.640
<i>Then, I’ll give you half.</i>

00:04:55.450 --> 00:04:56.750
<i>It’s delicious!</i>

00:04:56.750 --> 00:04:59.060
<i>I’m Jaqueline, and you?</i>

00:04:59.060 --> 00:05:01.730
<i>I-I’m Asano.</i>

00:05:03.420 --> 00:05:07.590
<i>H-Hey!! You stray cat!
Don’t you get near Jaqueline!</i>

00:05:07.590 --> 00:05:09.310
<i>I’ll come back!</i>

00:05:13.060 --> 00:05:15.930
That was my encounter
with Jaqueline.

00:05:15.930 --> 00:05:18.530
After that, I’ve been visiting her daily.

00:05:19.060 --> 00:05:19.920
<i>Jaqueline!</i>

00:05:23.400 --> 00:05:26.420
<i>I’m sorry... My owner has locked the windows.</i>

00:05:27.200 --> 00:05:28.890
<i>Oh... right...</i>

00:05:31.820 --> 00:05:32.870
<i>It’s alright!</i>

00:05:32.870 --> 00:05:36.290
<i>I’ll bring the sardines again, tomorrow,
and the day after that too...</i>

00:05:36.290 --> 00:05:37.850
<i>I’ll bring them again!</i>

00:05:39.420 --> 00:05:40.290
<i>But...</i>

00:05:40.290 --> 00:05:43.820
<i>Eventually, your owner will unlock the windows again.</i>

00:05:44.250 --> 00:05:45.990
<i>Asano-kun...</i>

00:05:46.550 --> 00:05:48.140
<i>H-Heey!!</i>

00:05:54.060 --> 00:05:59.960
While we continuously met,
we made a promise...

00:06:00.440 --> 00:06:04.820
<i>Some day, I would like to see what the
world is like, outside this window...</i>

00:06:04.820 --> 00:06:07.930
<i>I’ll get outside and eat a lot of sardines.</i>

00:06:08.650 --> 00:06:09.840
<i>Jaqueline...</i>

00:06:09.840 --> 00:06:15.430
<i>Then... the next time this window opens, I’ll take you out to see.</i>

00:06:17.870 --> 00:06:19.620
<i>I promise you!</i>

00:06:21.540 --> 00:06:26.180
So you fell in love with that young girl by the window?

00:06:26.820 --> 00:06:29.030
But... one day...

00:06:34.100 --> 00:06:35.910
<i>Jaqueline...</i>

00:06:45.310 --> 00:06:49.990
From that day on, Jaqueline didn’t show up by the window.

00:06:49.990 --> 00:06:53.760
Day after day after day... until...

00:06:53.760 --> 00:06:55.720
“We’ve moved to the Condo, –Ijuuin”

00:06:56.490 --> 00:07:00.250
Just like that, they moved
from the house...

00:07:03.290 --> 00:07:07.610
So that’s why you went into that train?
You were trying to look for her?

00:07:08.210 --> 00:07:13.070
I want to meet Jaqueline once again and
fulfill my promise, no matter what.

00:07:13.070 --> 00:07:17.260
I see... You went on a journey
for her, the one that you love?

00:07:17.260 --> 00:07:19.440
It’s so romantic!

00:07:22.390 --> 00:07:26.300
Alright! I’ll definitely find your Lilac Point girlfriend!

00:07:26.300 --> 00:07:31.190
Ichigo-oneechan has a boyfriend nowadays
so she’s excited about it.

00:07:31.190 --> 00:07:32.260
H-Hey...!

00:07:32.260 --> 00:07:37.290
Can I help out too, Asano-san?

00:07:44.960 --> 00:07:46.520
Thank you very much.

00:07:50.000 --> 00:07:52.010
It’s quite hard to find her, isn’t it?

00:07:52.010 --> 00:07:53.170
Let’s do our best.

00:07:53.170 --> 00:07:55.570
There are a lot more condos around this area.

00:07:57.850 --> 00:08:01.020
Oh! Jaqueline! That’s Jaqueline!

00:08:01.020 --> 00:08:01.750
Really?

00:08:07.230 --> 00:08:10.090
That is Jaqueline, I’m pretty sure!

00:08:10.090 --> 00:08:14.030
Oh, it says it’s Jaqueline from the Ijuuin-san’s.

00:08:14.030 --> 00:08:15.570
Wh-What?

00:08:15.570 --> 00:08:19.600
They’re taking applications for a
marriage-mate at the Cat Fair?

00:08:20.490 --> 00:08:25.520
Feel free to visit us with your male Lilac Point cat!?

00:08:25.520 --> 00:08:29.020
Could this be an omiai, by any chance?

00:08:29.020 --> 00:08:31.990
How can you do that kind of stuff!?

00:08:31.990 --> 00:08:33.630
Wh-what should we do?

00:08:33.630 --> 00:08:35.510
I don’t have the slightest idea.

00:08:35.510 --> 00:08:37.180
What are you doing, Ichigo?

00:08:39.350 --> 00:08:41.510
A-Aoyama-kun!

00:08:41.510 --> 00:08:45.040
What a lovely cat! What’s up?

00:08:45.040 --> 00:08:48.740
It came into the café by itself.
You can call him Asano-kun.

00:08:55.550 --> 00:09:00.010
The Cat Fair is a place where pedigreed
cats can find themselves a lover.

00:09:00.620 --> 00:09:06.480
The Abyssinian, the Persian, the Cornish
Rex and many other unusual cats visit.

00:09:06.870 --> 00:09:12.340
It seems that the owners of those cats
look for a marriage-mate for their cats.

00:09:12.340 --> 00:09:15.970
You see, such kittens can be sold for a handsome price.

00:09:17.430 --> 00:09:19.430
H-How horrible!

00:09:19.430 --> 00:09:21.720
Of course! We can’t let that happen!

00:09:21.720 --> 00:09:24.370
How could they rip the lovers apart just for money?!

00:09:25.220 --> 00:09:27.640
Ehm, actually... how should I put it...

00:09:27.640 --> 00:09:32.380
I just don’t think that buying animals and
forcing them to get together is right.

00:09:32.380 --> 00:09:33.660
You’re right...

00:09:34.360 --> 00:09:36.620
Nowadays, different breeds of cats and dogs

00:09:36.620 --> 00:09:39.750
...are created just for the convenience of us humans.

00:09:43.080 --> 00:09:47.050
I know! Asano-san, you can just
join the fair as an applicant.

00:09:48.020 --> 00:09:50.210
That’s impossible for sure!

00:09:50.210 --> 00:09:54.490
Because only Lilac Points like Jaqueline can marry her.

00:09:54.490 --> 00:09:59.430
Yes, but we should find a way to
get them together, definitely!

00:10:11.310 --> 00:10:13.000
I’m all finished!

00:10:16.070 --> 00:10:19.120
A-Amazing! I can’t tell the difference from a real one!

00:10:21.780 --> 00:10:24.410
Painting is my specialty!

00:10:24.410 --> 00:10:26.660
Asano-san, you look pretty cute.

00:10:26.660 --> 00:10:30.440
There’s a problem with the proportion,
but it’s not bad, I suppose...

00:10:30.940 --> 00:10:33.670
A-Are you sure this will work?

00:10:33.670 --> 00:10:35.190
I don’t have much confidence...

00:10:52.020 --> 00:10:55.440
There are so many unusual cats, aren’t there?

00:10:55.440 --> 00:10:57.590
Look! That cat is swimming!

00:10:58.190 --> 00:11:03.050
That one is a Turkish Angora. They
say it loves to shower and bathe.

00:11:03.050 --> 00:11:07.030
Anyway, where can
Jaqueline-san be?

00:11:07.030 --> 00:11:09.980
Well, we can’t see her
before the omiai.

00:11:12.080 --> 00:11:13.260
I can smell her.

00:11:13.260 --> 00:11:14.900
I can smell Jaqueine’s scent!

00:11:15.590 --> 00:11:16.250
Where?

00:11:16.250 --> 00:11:17.210
Over here!

00:11:17.210 --> 00:11:18.400
Ah– Asano-kun!

00:11:20.320 --> 00:11:21.120
Wait up!

00:11:22.110 --> 00:11:23.280
Ichigo!

00:11:23.950 --> 00:11:25.720
Ichigo-san, are you ok?

00:11:25.720 --> 00:11:27.080
Masha, what’s wrong?

00:11:27.080 --> 00:11:28.750
There’s an alien here!

00:11:36.270 --> 00:11:37.520
What are we going to do?

00:11:37.520 --> 00:11:39.300
Aaahh, why now?

00:11:39.300 --> 00:11:42.110
Bu-Ling and I will guard this place,

00:11:42.110 --> 00:11:44.310
Ichigo, you and Retasu should go and look for Asano-kun!

00:11:44.310 --> 00:11:45.260
Okay, thanks.

00:11:54.500 --> 00:11:56.510
Jaqueline... Jaqueline!

00:12:01.340 --> 00:12:02.630
Asano-kun?

00:12:02.630 --> 00:12:04.990
It’s you? You came for me?

00:12:04.990 --> 00:12:07.410
I’ve been looking for you
for a long time...

00:12:08.390 --> 00:12:09.410
I’m so happy...

00:12:09.410 --> 00:12:13.370
I was going to join the omiai so I can go with you.

00:12:13.370 --> 00:12:17.280
I’ll unlock you right away,
we’ll see the outer world together!

00:12:19.860 --> 00:12:21.650
Let’s go, Jaqueline,

00:12:21.650 --> 00:12:23.180
we’ll eat sardines together!

00:12:25.530 --> 00:12:27.100
Wh- What’s wrong?

00:12:28.200 --> 00:12:30.120
I’m sorry Asano-kun...

00:12:30.120 --> 00:12:32.980
I... can’t be with you...

00:12:34.390 --> 00:12:39.340
Wh-Why!? We made a promise, that
we’d go out together some day.

00:12:39.340 --> 00:12:43.360
If I run away, that person will get very lonely.

00:12:44.470 --> 00:12:45.360
That person...?

00:12:46.340 --> 00:12:50.390
My owner... I’m the only one that will stay with him...

00:12:50.390 --> 00:12:53.830
Because my owner no longer has anyone else.

00:12:59.310 --> 00:13:02.570
<i>If I die, I’d like to be
reincarnated as you...</i>

00:13:02.570 --> 00:13:06.470
<i>That seems to be impossible, so that’s
why I’m asking you something.</i>

00:13:07.240 --> 00:13:11.240
<i>I want you to stay next to him
instead of me.</i>

00:13:11.240 --> 00:13:13.430
<i>When he’s happy, hop onto his lap...</i>

00:13:13.910 --> 00:13:17.210
<i>...when he’s depressed, softly caress him.</i>

00:13:17.210 --> 00:13:18.400
<i>Please?</i>

00:13:18.830 --> 00:13:20.860
S-So that’s what happened...

00:13:23.750 --> 00:13:25.760
Okay.

00:13:25.760 --> 00:13:27.470
I understand.

00:13:28.280 --> 00:13:30.890
Jaqueline, this is good-bye...

00:13:30.890 --> 00:13:32.850
I’m glad I got to see you before you go.

00:13:34.220 --> 00:13:35.250
Asano-kun!

00:13:49.360 --> 00:13:51.250
Asano-kun, are you alright?

00:13:52.950 --> 00:13:56.200
I’m only a stray mottled cat anyway...

00:13:56.200 --> 00:13:58.500
I can’t join the omiai anymore.

00:13:58.500 --> 00:13:59.770
Asano-san...

00:14:00.670 --> 00:14:02.250
I have no regrets.

00:14:02.250 --> 00:14:05.260
I was able to meet Jaqueline and talk to her anyway.

00:14:06.800 --> 00:14:11.300
And she’ll get together with another Lilac Point...

00:14:11.300 --> 00:14:13.700
Then she should stay with her owner.

00:14:15.970 --> 00:14:20.670
<i>Now we’re starting the omiai
for the Lilac Points on stage!</i>

00:14:21.230 --> 00:14:25.020
I give up, but I’m not sad!

00:14:25.020 --> 00:14:27.130
Because it’s best for Jaqueline...

00:14:27.130 --> 00:14:30.660
Asano-san, are you giving up?

00:14:30.660 --> 00:14:32.390
Then you are wrong!

00:14:32.990 --> 00:14:35.220
That’s not what your true
feelings are...

00:14:41.370 --> 00:14:42.540
Masha, how’s it going?

00:14:42.540 --> 00:14:43.880
There’s no response.

00:14:44.570 --> 00:14:51.490
At last! Todays VIP! The ljuuins
Lilac Point: Jaqueline-chan!

00:14:53.720 --> 00:14:57.290
The first applicant is Ayano Kouji-san’s cat, Michel-kun.

00:15:02.600 --> 00:15:09.240
Come on! It’s just a bluff – it’s not as if Jaqueline-san doesn’t like you anymore...

00:15:10.900 --> 00:15:13.630
No matter what reasons you have,

00:15:13.630 --> 00:15:16.280
you shouldn’t force your lover to marry a cat she doesn’t like.

00:15:16.280 --> 00:15:18.120
The owner is too egoistic.

00:15:18.120 --> 00:15:18.930
Retasu...

00:15:19.500 --> 00:15:23.400
This way, Jaqueline-san will always be depressed.

00:15:24.170 --> 00:15:26.500
Yes... I think so too... I believe so!

00:15:26.500 --> 00:15:30.360
The only one that can make Jaqueline
happy, is you – Asano-kun, only you!

00:15:33.260 --> 00:15:35.030
Here it is, the interview!

00:15:37.260 --> 00:15:39.810
Oh, what a beautiful lady!

00:15:39.810 --> 00:15:43.500
Ah, you are the perfect mate for a lovely guy like me!

00:15:44.270 --> 00:15:47.020
We could be so happy
if we lived together...

00:15:47.020 --> 00:15:50.400
We could sprawl by the windows every
day while eating our meal...

00:15:50.400 --> 00:15:51.470
What are your preferences?

00:15:51.470 --> 00:15:56.640
Lean tuna sashimi? Skinless chicken
breast of... rabbit pateé?

00:15:57.200 --> 00:15:58.850
Stop that interview!

00:16:03.210 --> 00:16:03.980
Jaqueline!

00:16:04.870 --> 00:16:05.650
Asano-kun!

00:16:06.880 --> 00:16:08.360
Wh- Who are you!?

00:16:09.130 --> 00:16:10.570
I’m Jaqueline’s lover!

00:16:11.630 --> 00:16:12.890
What did you say!?

00:16:13.420 --> 00:16:15.300
What I like is sardines...

00:16:15.300 --> 00:16:17.080
Eh!? S-S-Sardines?

00:16:17.890 --> 00:16:19.810
Yes... Sardines.

00:16:19.810 --> 00:16:21.410
I love sardines!

00:16:21.410 --> 00:16:23.580
I love them, Asano-kun!

00:16:23.580 --> 00:16:27.700
That’s right! I won’t give away my Jaqueline!

00:16:29.770 --> 00:16:32.220
What is this supposed to mean!?!?

00:16:32.740 --> 00:16:33.510
That’s...!?

00:16:37.950 --> 00:16:41.730
(How dare you insult me, a natural aristocrat unlike you!)

00:16:46.290 --> 00:16:48.860
(I’ll chop you up into sasami and eat you!)

00:16:49.110 --> 00:16:50.820
Jaqueline! Watch out!

00:16:51.820 --> 00:16:52.820
Asano-kun!

00:16:52.820 --> 00:16:54.070
It’s dangerous!

00:16:54.070 --> 00:16:55.070
Let’s transform!

00:16:55.070 --> 00:16:56.030
Let’s go!

00:16:57.050 --> 00:17:00.810
Mew Mew Strawberry METAMORPHO-SE!

00:17:13.940 --> 00:17:17.410
Mew Mew Mint METAMORPHO-SE!

00:17:19.660 --> 00:17:23.080
Mew Mew Lettuce METAMORPHO-SE!

00:17:24.500 --> 00:17:27.960
Mew Mew Pudding METAMORPHO-SE!

00:17:37.180 --> 00:17:40.370
For the Earth’s future,
I’ll be of service! ~Nya!

00:17:42.760 --> 00:17:43.910
(Don’t bother me!)

00:17:43.910 --> 00:17:46.370
It’s a big kitty!

00:17:50.540 --> 00:17:52.520
Hey hey! You Chimera Anima!

00:17:52.520 --> 00:17:54.070
If you’re a cat, go fetch like a cat!

00:17:54.070 --> 00:17:55.220
Here! Try to catch it!

00:17:55.220 --> 00:17:56.550
(Who would...)

00:17:59.950 --> 00:18:00.890
There ya go!

00:18:02.450 --> 00:18:03.350
Take that!

00:18:03.350 --> 00:18:04.720
(Just like a cat!)

00:18:05.910 --> 00:18:07.910
Secret technique: Cat-amuser!

00:18:27.850 --> 00:18:30.820
Reborn Strawberry Surprise!

00:18:34.670 --> 00:18:36.870
(Tell me: what’s a “sardine”?)

00:18:40.110 --> 00:18:41.470
Retrieve, retrieve!

00:18:47.250 --> 00:18:48.460
Asano-kun!

00:18:48.910 --> 00:18:50.100
Jaqueline!

00:18:52.460 --> 00:18:53.760
Asano-san...

00:18:54.210 --> 00:18:57.780
Jaqueline! Are you alright, Jaqueline?

00:18:59.300 --> 00:19:00.990
Aren’t you that mottled cat?

00:19:02.760 --> 00:19:04.700
The one that used to visit us...

00:19:06.680 --> 00:19:11.210
Thank you so much for protecting Jaqueline, the most important memory of my wife...

00:19:13.100 --> 00:19:15.770
Jaqueline, it was all my fault...

00:19:15.770 --> 00:19:18.840
I was about to make a major mistake
and cause you trouble.

00:19:20.950 --> 00:19:23.160
I still remember...

00:19:23.160 --> 00:19:27.210
This cat used to visit
Jaqueline every day...

00:19:29.370 --> 00:19:32.120
Jaqueline is a keepsake
from my dead wife.

00:19:32.120 --> 00:19:34.670
I was going to find a good
partner for her.

00:19:35.710 --> 00:19:38.900
But she already had a good partner...

00:19:39.630 --> 00:19:42.680
So he came chasing after her...

00:19:42.680 --> 00:19:43.970
Come here...

00:19:43.970 --> 00:19:46.550
Aren’t you in love with Jaqueline too?

00:19:46.550 --> 00:19:48.910
Just like I was in love with my wife.

00:19:54.650 --> 00:19:55.690
I’ve decided...

00:19:55.690 --> 00:19:59.050
Jaqueline’s partner will be
this mottled cat.

00:20:00.030 --> 00:20:03.760
I’m sure he will make Jaqueline feel real happiness...

00:20:25.160 --> 00:20:27.670
He loves me... he hates me...
he loves me... he hates me...

00:20:27.670 --> 00:20:32.180
So Ichigo, you have to pull petals off a flower just to know how your boyfriend feels?

00:20:32.180 --> 00:20:35.340
You can’t count on fortune-telling anyway.

00:20:35.340 --> 00:20:36.680
It does help!

00:20:36.680 --> 00:20:40.510
Next: “Being honest:
Unrequited Love & Crystal Ball”

00:20:40.510 --> 00:20:43.300
He loves me... he hates me...

00:20:43.300 --> 00:20:44.470
He HATES me!?

00:20:44.470 --> 00:20:46.800
Y-Yeah, you can’t count on fortune-telling!

00:20:46.800 --> 00:20:49.390
Oh? They say you can’t underestimate fortune-telling!

00:20:49.390 --> 00:20:51.110
Geez!

00:20:51.110 --> 00:20:54.070
Heh, you are so simple-minded!
